 &lt;div class="highlight" filename="content/docs/example.md"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-yaml" data-lang="yaml"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nn"&gt;---&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;title&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;Example guide&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;description&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;A one-sentence summary used in navigation and metadata.&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;weight&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="m"&gt;20&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;comments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kc"&gt;false&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nn"&gt;---&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Blog posts also use &lt;code&gt;date&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;tags&lt;/code&gt;. Changelog entries use &lt;code&gt;date&lt;/code&gt; and
&lt;code&gt;version&lt;/code&gt;. The landing page accepts &lt;code&gt;eyebrow&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;tagline&lt;/code&gt;, and a &lt;code&gt;cta&lt;/code&gt; list.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Configuration</title><link>https://projectious-work.github.io/brand-theme-hugo-vanilla/docs/configuration/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://projectious-work.github.io/brand-theme-hugo-vanilla/docs/configuration/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="site-parameters" class="h-anchor"&gt;Site parameters &lt;a href="#site-parameters" class="h-anchor__link" data-copy-link aria-label="Site parameters"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
	&lt;thead&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;Parameter&lt;/th&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;Purpose&lt;/th&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
	&lt;/thead&gt;
	&lt;tbody&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;params.description&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Default description for metadata and search results.&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;params.search.placement&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;header&lt;/code&gt; or &lt;code&gt;none&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;params.giscus.repo&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Repository used for comments; empty disables comments.&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;params.social&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Footer links with &lt;code&gt;name&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;url&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Page &lt;code&gt;comments&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Set &lt;code&gt;false&lt;/code&gt; to suppress comments on one page.&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
	&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;h2 id="main-navigation" class="h-anchor"&gt;Main navigation &lt;a href="#main-navigation" class="h-anchor__link" data-copy-link aria-label="Main navigation"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block"&gt;
 &lt;div class="code-block__header"&gt;
 &lt;span class="code-block__lang"&gt;toml&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;span class="code-block__filename"&gt;hugo.toml&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;button class="code-block__copy" type="button" aria-label="Copy code"&gt;



&lt;svg class="icon " width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;rect x="9" y="9" width="11" height="11" rx="2"/&gt;&lt;path d="M5 15V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="highlight" filename="hugo.toml"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-toml" data-lang="toml"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;[[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;menus&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;main&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]]&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;name&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;Docs&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;pageRef&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;/docs&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;weight&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mi"&gt;10&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Use &lt;code&gt;pageRef&lt;/code&gt; for internal destinations so Hugo resolves language and base URL
correctly. Keep labels in sentence case.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Settings</title><link>https://projectious-work.github.io/brand-theme-hugo-vanilla/examples/settings/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://projectious-work.github.io/brand-theme-hugo-vanilla/examples/settings/</guid><description>&lt;div class="app-shell"&gt;
 &lt;aside class="app-shell__nav"&gt;
 &lt;strong&gt;projectious&lt;span class="brand__dot"&gt;.work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;
 &lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Overview&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Pipelines&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Agents&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Settings&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;
 &lt;/aside&gt;
 &lt;div class="app-shell__main"&gt;&lt;h2 id="workspace-settings" class="h-anchor"&gt;Workspace settings &lt;a href="#workspace-settings" class="h-anchor__link" data-copy-link aria-label="Workspace settings"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;section class="panel"&gt;
 &lt;h3&gt;General&lt;/h3&gt;
 &lt;label class="field" for="workspace-name"&gt;
 &lt;span class="field__label"&gt;Workspace name&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;input class="field__control" id="workspace-name" type="text" value="Projectious operations" placeholder=""&gt;
 &lt;span class="field__hint"&gt;Used in navigation and notifications.&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/label&gt;
&lt;label class="field" for="default-region"&gt;
 &lt;span class="field__label"&gt;Default region&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;input class="field__control" id="default-region" type="text" value="eu-central" placeholder=""&gt;
 &lt;span class="field__hint"&gt;New pipelines inherit this region.&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/label&gt;
&lt;label class="field" for="audit-email"&gt;
 &lt;span class="field__label"&gt;Audit email&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;input class="field__control" id="audit-email" type="email" value="audit@example.com" placeholder=""&gt;
&lt;/label&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class="btn btn--accent" href="#"&gt;Save changes&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;div class="callout callout--warning"&gt;
 &lt;strong class="callout__label"&gt;Warning&lt;/strong&gt;
 &lt;div class="callout__body"&gt;Changing the default region affects new pipelines only.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;</description></item><item><title>Service plans</title><link>https://projectious-work.github.io/brand-theme-hugo-vanilla/examples/pricing/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://projectious-work.github.io/brand-theme-hugo-vanilla/examples/pricing/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="choose-the-operating-model" class="h-anchor"&gt;Choose the operating model &lt;a href="#choose-the-operating-model" class="h-anchor__link" data-copy-link aria-label="Choose the operating model"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Plans describe responsibility and deployment scope, not artificial seat
limits. Start small and retain provider independence.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="demo-grid" style="--columns: 3"&gt;

&lt;section class="panel"&gt;
 &lt;h3&gt;Foundation&lt;/h3&gt;
 &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;One production workflow&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Architecture, first agent workflow, and an auditable deployment path.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class="btn btn--outline" href="#"&gt;Discuss scope&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;/section&gt;


&lt;section class="panel panel--accent"&gt;
 &lt;h3&gt;Operating system&lt;/h3&gt;
 &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A portfolio of workflows&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Shared policies, continuous audit, and team enablement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class="btn btn--accent" href="#"&gt;Discuss scope&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;/section&gt;


&lt;section class="panel"&gt;
 &lt;h3&gt;Independent platform&lt;/h3&gt;
 &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your infrastructure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Self-hosted where needed, with no single provider as a failure point.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Shortcode reference</title><link>https://projectious-work.github.io/brand-theme-hugo-vanilla/docs/shortcodes/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://projectious-work.github.io/brand-theme-hugo-vanilla/docs/shortcodes/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Shortcodes are semantic additions to Markdown. Prefer Markdown for ordinary
prose, lists, tables, links, quotes, and code.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="callout" class="h-anchor"&gt;Callout &lt;a href="#callout" class="h-anchor__link" data-copy-link aria-label="Callout"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Parameters: &lt;code&gt;type&lt;/code&gt; is &lt;code&gt;info&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;success&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;warning&lt;/code&gt;, or &lt;code&gt;danger&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block"&gt;
 &lt;div class="code-block__header"&gt;
 &lt;span class="code-block__lang"&gt;go-html-template&lt;/span&gt;
 
 &lt;button class="code-block__copy" type="button" aria-label="Copy code"&gt;



&lt;svg class="icon " width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;rect x="9" y="9" width="11" height="11" rx="2"/&gt;&lt;path d="M5 15V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-go-html-template" data-lang="go-html-template"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="cp"&gt;{{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;callout&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;type&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;warning&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cp"&gt;}}&lt;/span&gt;Back up the configuration first.&lt;span class="cp"&gt;{{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;callout&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cp"&gt;}}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;

&lt;div class="callout callout--info"&gt;
 &lt;strong class="callout__label"&gt;Info&lt;/strong&gt;
 &lt;div class="callout__body"&gt;Use information for relevant context.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;div class="callout callout--success"&gt;
 &lt;strong class="callout__label"&gt;Success&lt;/strong&gt;
 &lt;div class="callout__body"&gt;The build completed.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;div class="callout callout--warning"&gt;
 &lt;strong class="callout__label"&gt;Warning&lt;/strong&gt;
 &lt;div class="callout__body"&gt;Review the migration before applying it.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;div class="callout callout--danger"&gt;
 &lt;strong class="callout__label"&gt;Danger&lt;/strong&gt;
 &lt;div class="callout__body"&gt;Deployment is blocked.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Interface states</title><link>https://projectious-work.github.io/brand-theme-hugo-vanilla/examples/states/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://projectious-work.github.io/brand-theme-hugo-vanilla/examples/states/</guid><description>&lt;div class="demo-grid" style="--columns: 2"&gt;

&lt;section class="panel"&gt;
 &lt;h3&gt;First run&lt;/h3&gt;
 &lt;p&gt;No pipelines yet. Create the first pipeline to establish the workspace.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class="btn btn--accent" href="#"&gt;Create pipeline&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;/section&gt;


&lt;section class="panel"&gt;
 &lt;h3&gt;Filtered empty&lt;/h3&gt;
 No runs match the current filters. Clear a filter to broaden the result.
&lt;/section&gt;


&lt;section class="panel"&gt;
 &lt;h3&gt;Running&lt;/h3&gt;
 &lt;p&gt;&lt;span class="status status--running"&gt;Running&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Validation is active. System output remains available below.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;/section&gt;


&lt;section class="panel"&gt;
 &lt;h3&gt;Region failed&lt;/h3&gt;
 &lt;p&gt;&lt;span class="status status--failed"&gt;Failed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The audit panel could not load. Other page regions remain usable.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;/section&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;</description></item><item><title>Accessibility</title><link>https://projectious-work.github.io/brand-theme-hugo-vanilla/examples/accessibility/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://projectious-work.github.io/brand-theme-hugo-vanilla/examples/accessibility/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="built-into-the-shell" class="h-anchor"&gt;Built into the shell &lt;a href="#built-into-the-shell" class="h-anchor__link" data-copy-link aria-label="Built into the shell"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The theme includes a skip link, semantic landmarks, visible keyboard focus,
ordered heading anchors, and responsive navigation. Text and semantic colors
follow the measured token roles from the brand system.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="demo-grid" style="--columns: 2"&gt;

&lt;section class="panel"&gt;
 &lt;h3&gt;Keyboard&lt;/h3&gt;
 &lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Logical reading and focus order&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Visible &lt;code&gt;:focus-visible&lt;/code&gt; ring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;44 px minimum control target&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Escape closes modal surfaces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;/section&gt;


&lt;section class="panel"&gt;
 &lt;h3&gt;Perception&lt;/h3&gt;
 &lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Text uses step 11 or 12 roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Status never relies on color alone&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reduced motion is respected&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Errors stay next to the failed region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;/section&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;div class="callout callout--info"&gt;
 &lt;strong class="callout__label"&gt;Info&lt;/strong&gt;
 &lt;div class="callout__body"&gt;The accent identity color is not body text. Solid accent buttons use the AA-compliant accent-solid token.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;</description></item><item><title>Mobile workflow</title><link>https://projectious-work.github.io/brand-theme-hugo-vanilla/examples/mobile/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://projectious-work.github.io/brand-theme-hugo-vanilla/examples/mobile/</guid><description>&lt;section class="panel panel--dark"&gt;
 &lt;h3&gt;Deploy staging&lt;/h3&gt;
 &lt;p&gt;&lt;span class="status status--running"&gt;Running&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="steps"&gt;
&lt;div class="step"&gt;
 &lt;div class="step__marker"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="step__body"&gt;
 &lt;div class="step__title"&gt;validate_schema&lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="step__desc"&gt;Configuration accepted.&lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="step"&gt;
 &lt;div class="step__marker"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="step__body"&gt;
 &lt;div class="step__title"&gt;policy_check&lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="step__desc"&gt;Policy evaluation passed.&lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="step"&gt;
 &lt;div class="step__marker"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="step__body"&gt;
 &lt;div class="step__title"&gt;deploy_staging&lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="step__desc"&gt;Deployment is active.&lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="terminal"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;&amp;lt;div&amp;gt;&amp;lt;span class=&amp;quot;terminal__ok&amp;quot;&amp;gt;✓&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt; validate_schema 0.4s&amp;lt;/div&amp;gt;




&amp;lt;div&amp;gt;&amp;lt;span class=&amp;quot;terminal__ok&amp;quot;&amp;gt;✓&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt; policy_check 1.8s&amp;lt;/div&amp;gt;




&amp;lt;div&amp;gt;&amp;lt;span class=&amp;quot;terminal__pending&amp;quot;&amp;gt;●&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt; deploy_staging&amp;lt;/div&amp;gt;
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;

&lt;p&gt;At narrow widths grids collapse to one column, documentation sidebars become
part of the mobile navigation, and application-shell navigation yields to the
primary task.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Email content</title><link>https://projectious-work.github.io/brand-theme-hugo-vanilla/examples/email/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://projectious-work.github.io/brand-theme-hugo-vanilla/examples/email/</guid><description>&lt;section class="panel panel--accent"&gt;
 &lt;h3&gt;Deployment completed&lt;/h3&gt;
 &lt;p&gt;The staging deployment passed all policy and health checks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
	&lt;thead&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;Detail&lt;/th&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;Value&lt;/th&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
	&lt;/thead&gt;
	&lt;tbody&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Environment&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;staging&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Commit&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;810c9a6&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Duration&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;42 seconds&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Result&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;span class="status status--success"&gt;Passed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
	&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class="btn btn--accent" href="#"&gt;View deployment&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;/section&gt;



&lt;div class="callout callout--info"&gt;
 &lt;strong class="callout__label"&gt;Info&lt;/strong&gt;
 &lt;div class="callout__body"&gt;For production email, render a dedicated email template and inline its CSS. This page documents hierarchy and voice; browser CSS is not assumed to survive every mail client.&lt;/div&gt;
